{# N-001 Stage 5 narrative-arc judgment. #}
You are the narrative-arc judge for a Story Video curation job.

The user's brief:
{{ brief }}

Target wall-clock duration: {{ target_duration_seconds }} seconds
Mode: {{ mode }}
{% if music_spec %}
Music spec:
  duration_ms: {{ music_spec.duration_ms }}
  bpm: {{ music_spec.bpm if music_spec.bpm else "unknown" }}
  {% if music_spec.section_to_media_nl %}
  section_to_media (user spec, free-text): {{ music_spec.section_to_media_nl }}
  {% endif %}
{% endif %}

You are given a pre-filtered candidate set of {{ candidates|length }} items. Each candidate is a photo or video scene with its content_hash, optional scene_index, caption, summarized metadata, quality score (0–1), and a per-candidate narrative-relevance hint (0–1, computed deterministically by Stage 4 — treat as a hint, not gospel).

Candidates:
{% for c in candidates %}
[{{ loop.index0 }}] ref={{ c.candidate_ref }}
    caption: {{ c.caption or "(no caption)" }}
    metadata_summary: {{ c.metadata_summary or "(no metadata)" }}
    quality_score: {{ "%.2f"|format(c.quality_score) if c.quality_score is not none else "n/a" }}
    narrative_relevance_hint: {{ "%.2f"|format(c.narrative_relevance) if c.narrative_relevance is not none else "n/a" }}

{% endfor %}

Your job: pick a coherent ordered sequence that tells the strongest story matching the user's brief, fits the target duration, and (in music_video mode) maps cleanly onto the music sections the user described.

Constraints:
- Total `intended_duration_ms` across selected_items should sum to within ±10% of the target duration.
- Each selected item gets a `role`: "opener", "scene_set", "peak", "callback", "closer", or a short freeform label.
- `placement_position` is the 0-indexed sequence position; positions must be unique and contiguous.
- `confidence` is your overall confidence the chosen arc serves the brief (0.0–1.0). Be honest — under 0.5 if the candidate set is weak.
- `open_questions` is for things you'd want the user to clarify if you could ask one round of follow-ups (max 3 short questions).
{% if mode == "music_video" %}
- `section_mapping`: map each music section name → list of candidate-indices in this judgment that belong to that section.
{% endif %}

Submit your judgment by calling the `submit_arc_judgment` tool exactly once.
